      "result": "All 18 checklist items have been tested and recorded. \n\n**Summary:** 11 PASS / 7 FAIL\n\n**Key failures found:**\n- **FT-1**: New entries do not persist after a page reload (data is only kept in memory).\n- **FT-6 / CS-12**: No filter feature exists anywhere in the app.\n- **FT-19**: No import feature exists anywhere in the app.\n- **CS-20**: Quick search only matches raw internal values (e.g., ISO date `2026-01-15`), not the formatted values shown to users (e.g., `Jan 15, 2026` or checkbox `Yes`/`No`).\n\n**Passing highlights:** entry creation/display, field configuration (text/number/date/checkbox with type-appropriate controls), table/card view consistency, independent per-view sorting and manual drag-reordering, native browser validation preventing invalid number/date input, and case-insensitive text search with live count and clear.",
